  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>Camizestrant is an anti-estrogen drug being developed for the treatment of breast cancer. It is still investigational and not yet in routine use, though a positive regulatory opinion exists in the European Union.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q124721211&quot;>Wikidata Q124721211</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>camizestrant</td></tr><tr><td>ATC codes:</td><td>L02BA05</td></tr><tr><td>DrugBank:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://go.drugbank.com/drugs/DB19218&quot;>DB19218</a></td></tr><tr><td>PubChem CID:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/134453496&quot;>134453496</a></td></tr><tr><td>Wikidata:</td><td><a href=&quot;https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q124721211&quot;>Q124721211</a></td></tr><tr><td>formula:</td><td>C24H28F4N6</td></tr><tr><td>molar mass:</td><td>476.522 g/mol (PubChem)</td></tr></table></body></html>"));
